  "traps": [
    "dispatch has no go.mod and no Gopkg file (Gopkg.lock is only in .gitignore): dispatch/Dockerfile runs go mod init dispatch && go get, so the module path dispatch and every version of github.com/instana/go-sensor, opentracing-go and streadway/amqp exist only inside the image build; the unit is a source-tree with no declared dependency",
    "web is a source-tree too: static AngularJS pages, an nginx template and an entrypoint script, no package.json; AngularJS 1.6.7 and angular-route come from ajax.googleapis.com in index.html, auto-complete.js and its CSS are a checked-in copy of Pixabay autoComplete v1.0.4",
    "ratings/html/composer.json has no name, so the PHP unit is named by its root; php ^7.4 and ext-curl, ext-json, ext-pdo in require are platform requirements, not packages; there is no composer.lock and the Dockerfile copies composer from the untagged composer image",
    "payment and load-gen have only requirements.txt with bare names and no project name; payment is served by uwsgi through payment/payment.ini (wsgi-file payment.py), load-gen by the locust command in load-gen/entrypoint.sh",
    "shipping declares versions only for instana-java-sdk and httpclient: the rest come from the parent spring-boot-starter-parent 2.3.3.RELEASE, whose spring-boot-dependencies BOM on Maven Central fixes spring-retry 1.2.5.RELEASE and mysql-connector-java 8.0.21; the parent is not a dependency of the unit",
    "the parent reads java.version 1.8 into maven.compiler.source and target; the build stage of shipping/Dockerfile is debian:10 with apt maven (no Maven or JDK version written), the run stage is openjdk:8-jdk",
    "no service names another in a manifest: every link is an env var with a default host in code (CATALOGUE_HOST, USER_HOST, CART_HOST, REDIS_HOST, MONGO_URL, AMQP_HOST, DB_HOST, CART_ENDPOINT, CATALOGUE_URL, PDO_URL); depends_on is empty everywhere",
    "nginx routes /api/<service>/ to <service>:8080/ stripping the prefix, except ratings on port 80; the browser and load-gen call /api/ratings/api/fetch/<sku>, because the Symfony controller adds its own /api prefix",
    "mongo and mysql are units only because docker-compose.yaml builds them: mongo/*.js are mongo shell scripts copied into docker-entrypoint-initdb.d, not Node.js; mysql/scripts/10-dump.sql.gz is a 16 MB gzip dump of the cities database",
    "four deployment trees disagree with docker-compose.yaml: the Helm chart runs redis:4.0.6 and rabbitmq:3.7-management-alpine against redis:6.2-alpine and rabbitmq:3.8-management-alpine; dispatch/ and payment/ have their own compose files with rabbitmq:3.7; DCOS still names the image rs-shipping-db and has no ratings service",
    "mongo:5, mysql:5.7, nginx:1.21.6 and fluentd are base images of services, not toolchains; alpine and debian:10 are operating systems",
    "Redis is the only store of carts (setex with a one-hour expiry) and of the user counter: a cache by product, not a durable database",
    "prom-client and prometheus_client expose /metrics, but no Prometheus server is configured anywhere; the Instana agent is not in docker-compose.yaml, only in Swarm/instana-agent.sh and as INSTANA_AGENT_HOST from the node IP in the Helm templates",
    "the only CI workflow runs docker-compose build: no toolchain version in .github; .env TAG=2.1.0 and Chart.yaml version 1.1.0 are image and chart versions"
  ],
